Package: wk2xxx-dkms
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: sdyspb
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1), make, gcc, build-essential, linux-headers-current-rockchip64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: WK2124 SPI to 4x UART driver (DKMS)
 Kernel driver for WK2124 / WK2132 / WK2168 / WK2202 / WK2204.
 Exposes four UART channels as /dev/ttyWK0..3.
